---
title: "C23 — Trunk and review flow · Operating model"
---
flowchart LR
  Main[Current main] --> Branch[Short-lived feature branch]
  Branch --> Task[One coherent task and tests]
  Task --> PR[Pull request]
  PR --> Checks[Required CI checks]
  Checks --> Review[Review and merge]
  Review --> Next[Updated main]
  Next --> Candidate[Independent release candidates]
  Stack[Stacked PRs target their parent until it lands] -. review option .-> PR
  Envs[dev, qa, stage and prod are deployments] -. not permanent source branches .-> Candidate
